---
source: crates/forgejo-core/src/error/render.rs
expression: "snap(ErrorKind::PaginationDidNotTerminate { pages: 10_000, items: 500_000 },\nc)"
---
error: pagination stopped after 10000 pages without reaching the end

  request:       GET /api/v1/repos/perf3ct/fcli/issues
  pages fetched: 10000
  items so far:  500000

what to do:
  the page limit was reached before the server indicated the end of the results.
  check whether the server ignores ?page or a proxy strips the Link and
  X-Total-Count headers.
  1. inspect the response headers: fcli api repos/perf3ct/fcli/issues -i
  2. request a limited number of items: fcli api repos/perf3ct/fcli/issues --limit 500
  3. report unexpected pagination behavior to the server or proxy administrator
  note: the request failed because the result may be incomplete.
